# daRTING source of truth

This project is a dart game only. The rules are in `DARTS_HANDBOOK.md`.

- Read that file before answering rules questions or writing game logic.
- Do not ask the user to restate rules already in it.
- The product is a phone-camera scorer with the game menu in the handbook. The playable build is the web app in `app/` (Vite, React, TypeScript). Flutter remains the packaging target when that SDK is available. Automatic tip detection is not implemented; the player taps the bed.
- Default game: 501, straight in, double out.
- Build the rules engine and voice before the camera.
- Do not add equipment, oche, dress, tournament, league, or federation material unless the user asks.
- If the user changes a rule, update the handbook and its change log in the same session.
